{"seq":2,"slug":"async-fibers","title":"异步与 Fiber","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/php-modern-backend/modern/async-fibers","wordCount":1267,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"异步与-fiber\">异步与 Fiber</h1><p>长期以来，「PHP 不能做异步」是它最被诟病的短板之一。在经典的 shared-nothing 模型里，一个请求里若要并发地调三个外部 API，只能一个接一个串行等待，CPU 大量时间空耗在 I/O 阻塞上。PHP 8.1 引入的 Fiber 改变了这一切——它提供了协作式多任务的底层原语，让 PHP 终于能用「看起来同步、实际异步」的方式处理并发 I/O。配合 FrankenPHP、Swoole、RoadRunner 这些常驻运行时，PHP 的并发能力进入了一个新量级。这一节直接呼应 <a href=\"../foundations/request-lifecycle\">请求生命周期与 SAPI</a> 里讲的经典模型，是对它的突破。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>要理解 PHP 的异步，先分清三个层次：Fiber 是语言提供的「可暂停/恢复函数」的底层机制；事件循环（如 ReactPHP、AmPHP）在 Fiber 之上构建调度逻辑；常驻运行时（FrankenPHP、Swoole、RoadRunner）则是承载这一切的进程模型。Fiber 本身不是异步框架，它只是让「在等待 I/O 时把控制权让出去」成为可能。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[并发 I/O 需求] --&gt; B[Fiber: 可暂停/恢复函数&lt;br/&gt;语言原语 8.1]&#10;  B --&gt; C[事件循环&lt;br/&gt;ReactPHP / AmPHP]&#10;  C --&gt; D{运行时模型}&#10;  D --&gt;|事件循环 + 协程| E[Swoole/OpenSwoole]&#10;  D --&gt;|常驻 worker| F[FrankenPHP / RoadRunner]&#10;  D --&gt;|纯 PHP 事件循环| G[ReactPHP]&#10;  E --&gt; H[高并发长连接 WebSocket]&#10;  F --&gt; I[摊薄初始化, 高吞吐 HTTP]\">flowchart TD\n  A[并发 I/O 需求] --&gt; B[Fiber: 可暂停/恢复函数&lt;br/&gt;语言原语 8.1]\n  B --&gt; C[事件循环&lt;br/&gt;ReactPHP / AmPHP]\n  C --&gt; D{运行时模型}\n  D --&gt;|事件循环 + 协程| E[Swoole/OpenSwoole]\n  D --&gt;|常驻 worker| F[FrankenPHP / RoadRunner]\n  D --&gt;|纯 PHP 事件循环| G[ReactPHP]\n  E --&gt; H[高并发长连接 WebSocket]\n  F --&gt; I[摊薄初始化, 高吞吐 HTTP]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运行时</th>\n<th>并发模型</th>\n<th>是否需扩展</th>\n<th>突出场景</th>\n<th>PHP 基金会关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FrankenPHP</td>\n<td>常驻 worker（基于 Go/Caddy）</td>\n<td>否（独立二进制）</td>\n<td>高吞吐 HTTP、worker 模式</td>\n<td>获官方支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Swoole / OpenSwoole</td>\n<td>协程 + 事件循环</td>\n<td>是（C 扩展）</td>\n<td>高并发、长连接、WebSocket</td>\n<td>第三方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RoadRunner</td>\n<td>常驻 worker（Go 进程管理）</td>\n<td>否（Go 二进制）</td>\n<td>worker 模式、队列</td>\n<td>第三方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ReactPHP / AmPHP</td>\n<td>纯 PHP 事件循环</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>异步客户端、自建 server</td>\n<td>第三方</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fiber-协作式多任务的原语\">Fiber：协作式多任务的原语</h2><p>Fiber 让你能创建一个「可以中途暂停、之后再恢复」的执行单元。它与线程的本质区别是「协作式」：Fiber 不会被操作系统抢占，只有它自己调用 <code>Fiber::suspend()</code> 主动让出时才会暂停，调用 <code>resume()</code> 才会继续。这意味着没有数据竞争、不需要锁——任一时刻只有一个 Fiber 在跑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"php\" data-code=\"$fiber = new Fiber(function (): void {&#10;    echo &quot;开始\\n&quot;;&#10;    $value = Fiber::suspend(&#39;暂停了&#39;);  // 主动让出，把 &#39;暂停了&#39; 传给外部&#10;    echo &quot;恢复后收到: {$value}\\n&quot;;&#10;});&#10;&#10;$suspended = $fiber-&gt;start();   // 输出「开始」，返回 &#39;暂停了&#39;&#10;echo &quot;外部看到: {$suspended}\\n&quot;;&#10;$fiber-&gt;resume(&#39;继续吧&#39;);        // 恢复，输出「恢复后收到: 继续吧」\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>$fiber = new Fiber(function (): void {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"开始\\n\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    $value = Fiber::suspend('暂停了');  // 主动让出，把 '暂停了' 传给外部</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"恢复后收到: {$value}\\n\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>$suspended = $fiber->start();   // 输出「开始」，返回 '暂停了'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo \"外部看到: {$suspended}\\n\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>$fiber->resume('继续吧');        // 恢复，输出「恢复后收到: 继续吧」</span></span></code></pre></div><p>裸用 Fiber 很少见——它是给框架作者准备的底层积木。真正的价值在于：事件循环库可以在某个操作等待 I/O 时 <code>suspend</code> 当前 Fiber、去跑别的 Fiber，I/O 就绪后再 <code>resume</code>。这样单线程就能并发处理大量 I/O，而业务代码读起来却是同步的、没有回调地狱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件循环与并发-i-o\">事件循环与并发 I/O</h2><p>在 AmPHP、ReactPHP 这样的事件循环库里，Fiber 让你能并发地发起多个 I/O 操作然后一起等待结果。设想要并发抓取三个 URL，串行需要三次往返的总时长，并发则只需最慢那一次：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"php\" data-code=\"use function Amp\\async;&#10;use function Amp\\Future\\await;&#10;&#10;// 并发发起三个请求，await 一起等待&#10;$responses = await([&#10;    async(fn() =&gt; $client-&gt;request(&#39;https://a.example/api&#39;)),&#10;    async(fn() =&gt; $client-&gt;request(&#39;https://b.example/api&#39;)),&#10;    async(fn() =&gt; $client-&gt;request(&#39;https://c.example/api&#39;)),&#10;]);&#10;// 总耗时 ≈ max(t1, t2, t3)，而非 t1 + t2 + t3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use function Amp\\async;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use function Amp\\Future\\await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 并发发起三个请求，await 一起等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>$responses = await([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async(fn() => $client->request('https://a.example/api')),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async(fn() => $client->request('https://b.example/api')),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async(fn() => $client->request('https://c.example/api')),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 总耗时 ≈ max(t1, t2, t3)，而非 t1 + t2 + t3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用一个简化模型衡量收益：串行总延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{seq} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，并发总延迟约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{conc} \\approx \\max_i t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。当 I/O 占比高、请求数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 大时，加速比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{seq}/T_{conc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可观。注意 Fiber 加速的是 I/O 等待，不是 CPU 计算——CPU 密集型任务的优化要靠 <a href=\"../practice/performance-opcache\">性能与 OPcache</a> 里讲的 JIT。</p>\n<h2 id=\"worker-运行时与-shared-nothing-的取舍\">worker 运行时与 shared-nothing 的取舍</h2><p>FrankenPHP、Swoole、RoadRunner 这些运行时把 PHP 进程变成常驻：启动时初始化一次（加载框架、建连接、预热），之后循环处理请求。基准测试中 FrankenPHP worker 模式可达约 15000 req/s，而传统 PHP-FPM 约 4000 req/s，差距来自摊薄了每请求的初始化成本——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/request-lifecycle\">请求生命周期与 SAPI</a> 里预告过的突破。FrankenPHP 还获得了 PHP 基金会的官方支持，社区认为它「用 10% 的迁移成本拿到 80% 的性能收益」。</p>\n<p>但代价是 shared-nothing 的保护消失了。进程跨请求存活意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>状态泄漏</strong>：上一个请求残留在静态变量、容器单例里的数据，可能污染下一个请求，甚至泄漏用户数据。</li>\n<li><strong>内存累积</strong>：没释放干净的引用会随请求数堆积，最终 OOM——所以 worker 通常设「处理 N 个请求后重启」。</li>\n<li><strong>连接管理</strong>：数据库连接要复用，但也要处理断线重连。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以 worker 模式要求代码更「干净」：避免可变全局状态、警惕单例缓存、确保每请求结束后重置。这与 <a href=\"../language/error-handling\">错误与异常处理</a> 也相关——一个未捕获异常若让 worker 进程崩溃，影响的不只是当前请求。可以说，worker 模式用「放弃 shared-nothing 的安全网」换取了「摊薄初始化的高性能」，是一道需要工程纪律来守住的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Fiber（8.1）是协作式多任务原语：函数可主动 <code>suspend</code>/<code>resume</code>，单线程无数据竞争。</li>\n<li>裸 Fiber 是给框架作者的底层积木；事件循环（AmPHP/ReactPHP）在其上实现并发 I/O。</li>\n<li>并发 I/O 把总延迟从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，但只加速 I/O 等待、不加速 CPU。</li>\n<li>worker 运行时（FrankenPHP/Swoole/RoadRunner）只初始化一次、循环处理，吞吐成倍提升。</li>\n<li>代价是 shared-nothing 保护消失：需防状态泄漏、内存累积，要求代码更干净、纪律更严。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>数据来源：php.net Fiber 官方文档；FrankenPHP 官方与基准（devm.io、your-digital-hub.com，2026）；Symfony Runtime 文档。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"异步与 Fiber","id":"异步与-fiber"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Fiber：协作式多任务的原语","id":"fiber-协作式多任务的原语"},{"level":2,"text":"事件循环与并发 I/O","id":"事件循环与并发-i-o"},{"level":2,"text":"worker 运行时与 shared-nothing 的取舍","id":"worker-运行时与-shared-nothing-的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Composer 与 PSR 规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/php-modern-backend/modern/composer-psr"},"next":{"title":"属性与反射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/php-modern-backend/modern/attributes-reflection"}}